45000591842", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618937_1834345003925175_5478665649142861445_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RfhblnAQlR0Q7kNvwH7PSkH&_nc_oc=AdqHpMHRIkJjl7ROaQLgXDP8e9r2kUZ9PZxgQ0yA0RbyfVDiHjJSk24I3noYMyXw5Ig&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLZhCjsWx_ezMLpnuNEktzKyfD1Kj07PBH9NdhRWp7Adg&oe=6AA0001D"}, {"file_name": "cardio_4.png", "id": "2037707833805317", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619685_2037707840471983_4135399153016581970_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nGq7DjKbRp8Q7kNvwFQYApe&_nc_oc=Adpf6WQ6D4JDaCwZEhwQDSEa1HcLouj1OHtmeAVo1DrAekzfIN7BkX3ScFh46pFyT98&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKqUcAvfUO5VtzpSZ3kkmsWqPUORBF3IpVv8CKKnVZJ6Q&oe=6AA00D25"}, {"file_name": "action_punch2.png", "id": "4456994924626479", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619096_4456994927959812_4915582525324150651_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PBjqbMI4mq0Q7kNvwF0882v&_nc_oc=AdqgX28dkIAxxYC8BqO5uLK08NsqZHvNiLJH1AIjGkNpLNnoVMYWAZX339otYfuUgpM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLNtsow_p_5fd51_oZJFU3tt_tMyOx_bRsYFZ2LoPts-Q&oe=6AA02E1D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "all_store_trailer_cover.png", "id": "832246496410471", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/618758916_832246499743804_807888169328533235_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hvlByax5tEYQ7kNvwHSHyvd&_nc_oc=AdpESt2_GY62CVweDfFDdzn_SBOjvfXSk3YrfLpWIyjEszUdcecO8FpIOBrPk-AleqM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQItYlTNmvai126sls-9JCDEfZKOb8S5uK0TexqYX0_-eA&oe=6AA01FC2"}, "display_name": "Anatomy Learning Labs: Cardio Lab", "keywords": ["anatomy", "biology", "learning", "heart", "cardio"], "long_description": "Step into the Cardio Lab of the Anatomy Learning Labs series, where science meets wonder inside the engine of human life in stunning 3D. Featuring anatomically accurate models developed by medical professionals and learning activities designed by professors, the Cardio Lab teaches elementary, middle, and high school learners how the heart, blood vessels, and blood flow work together to deliver oxygen and nutrients throughout the body.\n\nThis app leverages the Quest's audio, visual, and hand-tracking capabilities to deliver truly multimodal and active learning experiences. Students learn by seeing anatomy in 3D, hearing explanations, interacting with structures using their own hands, and developing spatial reasoning skills through guided activities.\n\n\u2022   Operate a CT-scanner to reveal how the vascular system aligns with the skeletal system and internal organs.\n\n\u2022   Select any structure to hear Dr. Hana Sato, your virtual guide, identify it by name and explain its function.\n\n\u2022   Use your own hands to grab and inspect the heart, major blood vessels, and related cardiovascular structures.\n\n\u2022   Step into Mini Mode to see the inside of the heart and explore its chambers, valves, and blood flow pathways.\n\n\u2022   Assemble the heart in a guided 3D puzzle.\n\n\u2022   Test your knowledge through audio-guided quizzes led by Dr. Sato.\n\n\u2022   Put your skills to the test in the Knowledge Knockout challenge, where you must quickly identify the correct cardiovascular structure and strike it before time runs out!", "short_description": "Step into an immersive VR cardiovascular laboratory and explore how the heart, blood vessels, and blood flow keep the human body alive in stunning 3D. Travel through medical imaging views, examine cardiovascular structures using natural hand-tracking, and hear Dr. Hana Sato identify anatomy by name and explain its function. Assemble the heart, test your knowledge with quizzes, and reinforce learning through engaging challenges designed to make anatomy memorable and fun."}]}, "developer_name":